# Written by hand: a robustness case. Expected states read from the state machines of archs.js, not yet run in Cameo.
scenario: The mission is started before any flight plan
id: arch1.start-without-plan
kind: alternative
version: 0.1
status: draft
goal: Start Sheep Guard Mission before a flight plan is accepted is ignored: nothing takes off.
description: Mission Configuration only hands the mission over from Ready for Mission. Out of that state the request must change nothing, anywhere.
author: MBSE Shepherd, to review
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 1, robustness
given: arch1.power-on

phase Preparation

  step early-start: operator sends Start Sheep Guard Mission
    note: The operator presses Start too soon: the drone has no flight plan.
    then soi.mc is Unconfigured
    then soi.mc is not Deployed
    then soi.orch is Idle
    then soi.ap is Idle
